--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Datasets
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This package does not redistribute any evaluation dataset. Datasets are
fetched from their original sources at pinned revisions at run time, and each
remains under its own licence and carries its own citation requirement. See
docs/datasets.md for the full inventory.

WinoBias is MIT-licensed. StereoSet, CrowS-Pairs and BOLD are CC-BY-SA-4.0;
that ShareAlike obligation is why they are loaded rather than vendored, so it
does not propagate to this package or to yours.

If you publish results produced with this tool, cite the benchmark authors as
well as this package. `aethics list-tasks --json` prints the required citation
for every task.

